{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f87a4893323b4e65","name":"Elite Warrior","source":{"id":"source:reference-f87a4893323b4e65","title":"Elite Warrior","revision":18910,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:57:41Z","sha256":"eb62fd62c6964b53e120272fb652106e48ad8f4d028a77aaa8c718c2e72dc3d1","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18910","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Elite%20Warrior&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f87a4893323b4e65","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Elite Warriors include a broad array of professional soldiers who benefit from advanced combat training and who are familiar with a large variety of weaponry. Many Elite Warriors are former rank-and-file soldiers who have proved their fighting expertise to their superior officers. A few might be members of a veteran squad, their experience giving them the edge they need to survive. Other Elite Warriors could be members of legendary fighting outfits, noted for their discipline and their record of victories.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Elite Warrior Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["An encounter with one or more Elite Warriors is especially dangerous, since these soldiers have far more advanced training than their lesser counterparts do. Skilled in a variety of fighting techniques, from hand-to-hand combat to the use of heavy weaponry, Elite Warriors are equipped to face and destroy just about any threat that comes against them. The presence of a single Elite Warrior can shift the tide of a large battle.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Elite Warriors have many similarities to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Commandos"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Commandos"},", and in fact, the might lead small teams of these other soldiers. The Elite Warrior is generally chosen for the most dangerous missions, often against overwhelming numbers. Such missions fall on these characters' shoulders because they, and only they, can get the job done. As a result, Elite Warriors are often dispatched to poisonous worlds, sent to lead the vanguard of an attack against an entrenched unit, or even used as shock troops, dropping in and wiping out all resistance to securing a landing site for the main force.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Elite Warrior Statistics (CL 14)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 3/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 8/",{"tag":"a","children":["Elite Trooper"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Elite_Trooper","referenceId":"reference:02fa86cb25e21540"}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +15; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, 1 Unassigned\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 28 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 25), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"hre